{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>《Video Diary》是一款以每日短片記錄生活的私人影片日誌，適合想建立每日拍攝習慣的家長、旅遊者、Vlogger，以及希望簡單保存日常回憶的人。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>；影片保存在本機，無需帳戶，亦不會上傳雲端。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-179.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>每日短片私人日記</h2>\n<p>你可每天用相機錄製一秒或完整短片，也可從相片圖庫匯入當日片段，並在可滾動的時間軸上順暢重播回憶。程式提供連續紀錄天數、每月片段數量及活動圖表等統計，亦支援匯入與匯出整份日記作備份。影片以離線優先方式保存在 iPhone 或 iPad，無需登入，不含廣告與追蹤，讓私人影片日誌更易持續。</p>\n<figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-201-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-202-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-203-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-204-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-205-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Video Diary-Daily Vlog Clip</li>\n<li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li>\n<li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/video-diary-daily-vlog-clip/id6784488049?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li>\n</ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T07:28:39.951270+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":337,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T07:06:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T11:13:59.750663+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T07:22:03.084308+00:00","content_hash":"7cc008ebad5268bb6a8df85fb503476f922259d037115698ea3b8786116f6ca5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}